      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The Multimodal Knowledge Agent (MKA) benchmark, developed with Artificial Analysis, evaluates how agents reason across visually complex files to solve real-world knowledge work tasks.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/gemini-models/multimodal-knowledge-agent-benchmark/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-10T17:44:09.110Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Gemini 4 Carbon provides top quality at a fraction of the price of similar models.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/gemini-models/multimodal-knowledge-agent-benchmark/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-10T17:44:09.110Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In partnership with Artificial Analysis, we're launching MKA (Multimodal Knowledge Agent) , a new benchmark built to evaluate how agents reason across visually complex files to solve real-world knowledge work tasks.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/gemini-models/multimodal-knowledge-agent-benchmark/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-10T17:44:09.110Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "To ground the benchmark in real-world workflows, we partnered with domain experts across 10 verticals and 83 occupations where day-to-day work is inherently visual.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/gemini-models/multimodal-knowledge-agent-benchmark/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-10T17:44:09.110Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Each task reflects a multi-step project that takes a seasoned professional three to eight hours to complete, pairing a realistic prompt and a bundle of multimodal input files with an expert-written rubric of roughly 70 yes/no checks, weighted 75% on factual accuracy and 25% on…",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/gemini-models/multimodal-knowledge-agent-benchmark/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-10T17:44:09.110Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Gemini 4 Carbon is on the pareto frontier of quality and price for the MKA eval.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/gemini-models/multimodal-knowledge-agent-benchmark/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-10T17:44:09.110Z"
      },
      {
